"NSMicrophoneUsageDescription" = "dayalogue uses the microphone when you record the story of your day. The audio is sent only to be turned into text and is not kept: only the text is saved.";
"NSFaceIDUsageDescription" = "dayalogue uses Face ID so that only you can open your diary.";
"NSCameraUsageDescription" = "dayalogue uses the camera only when you choose to take a photo for your profile or for your day. No photo is ever taken on its own.";
"NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription" = "dayalogue opens your photo library only when you choose a photo for your profile or for your day. Only the photos you pick are read.";
